WEBVTT

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:12.790
This could still work out for us.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:17.500
Our target is an adventurer
no one seems to know much about.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:20.670
I want this taken care of before the new moon.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:27.830
Kilia

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.000
Wow! Yuji!

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.710
This place is huge!

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:30.750
Sure is.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.290
Wonder if there's anything yummy to eat.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:34.040
Like some meat? Hope there's meat!

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.540
You slimes are quite the carnivores, eh?

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.420
I'm gonna eat till I'm a jumbo slime!

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:44.460
Now that I think of it, we've walked
all this way without stopping to eat.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:49.040
Maybe we're causing a bit too much of a scene, though...

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.920
Yuji, look! Look!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.210
I'll take one, if you would.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:03.170
Sure, coming up!

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:07.080
Can I buy that off you, too?

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.420
Huh?

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:15.210
This is so good!

00:01:15.210 --> 00:01:17.250
Don't get better than this!

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.540
What a delicacy!

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.630
Sure ain't bad!

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:27.170
What's that about?

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.000
People can gather to hear the good word at the church.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:33.170
A high priest from Central is in town, you see.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:38.420
Central...

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:08.080
Brushing things off with a "whatever"

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.130
Stuck later in an unchanging life

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.380
The whatevers became habit

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:16.630
My skills still have yet to bloom

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:21.580
If I don't try to win and but am unwilling to lose

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:27.290
Why does this cold heart still beat with time?

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:33.580
All of us are monsters with hidden powers

00:02:33.580 --> 00:02:39.460
Are we going to live without awakening them?

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.460
We push things down and cover them up

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:45.330
And our hearts are fresh no more

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:50.080
But we're monsters who continue on without so much as a face

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:56.500
All of us have undiscovered powers hidden inside

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.330
You're up next

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:06.040
Stand and face it monster

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:19.080
So you're a tamer...

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.080
Am I not cut out to register with the guild here?

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:25.500
Well, unfortunately...

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.170
Oh, no, you're all set.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:43.000
We take in anyone with enemy tracking abilities.
No questions asked.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:47.290
Having someone in the party with those skills
drops the death rate by 80 percent.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:48.710
You're skills will be greatly appreciated.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.920
There. You're all registered.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:54.080
Thanks.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.290
Would you like to take on a guild request?

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:07.080
You the guy looking for a party?

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.630
The name's Rodis. Dagger expert.

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:13.040
I'm Tina, the archer.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.880
And I'm Lisa, the lancer.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.500
Haven't seen you around before.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:24.460
My name's Yuji. This will be my first party.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:26.540
I'm a tamer.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:31.210
Huh? A tamer? Do you even know how to fight?

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:33.790
I'm not looking for any extra baggage.

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:36.290
I figured that's how it might be.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.080
But you're good with tracking, right?

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.630
We're only headed out to investigate,

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.920
so we'd be better off avoiding monsters
than fighting our way through them.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:50.170
Honestly, if I'm gonna complain about anyone
it would be Rodis.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.880
Haven't heard much good news about you.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:57.630
Yeah. I even heard your whole team ran off
and went missing last time.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.330
Don't go believing all those rumors.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.170
Or what, are you kicking me out?

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:04.130
Well I mean...

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.920
You can only blame yourself.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.210
C'mon, don't give me that!

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.040
It's the same everywhere, huh?

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:18.000
Fine, if you let Yuji in, we'll keep you in, too.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:19.330
How's that sound?

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:20.460
Fine by me!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.880
Let's go over our request.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.920
We're headed out to find where
the Earth Dragon is hiding.

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:39.460
We don't have to fight it, but it's
a powerful creature, so let's stay alert.

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.960
Rodis will take the lead.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.000
I'll take the middle.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.420
And you'll hold up the rear, okay Lisa?

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.170
What should I do?

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:51.830
You just stay focused on detecting any nearby enemies.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.880
Seems there's no need for me to fight.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:57.830
Proud Wolf, what's the situation?

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.380
Nothin' to report.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.790
We have every rock and tree under watch.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:10.380
Leave any monsters to us.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:13.330
Yuji, are we gonna beat 'em up if we find any?

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.580
No, stand down for now.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:17.210
Wait, really?

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.330
Oughta just take them down.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.960
Just keep your eyes peeled.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:23.880
Copy that.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.210
Huh?

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.920
Yuji, we've got contact.

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:33.420
There are five wolf-like monsters
up two kilometers ahead.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.000
Two kilometers?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.420
That's not exactly a distance you can just see from.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.040
Your tracking skills work from that far away?

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:42.380
Trust me.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.330
Well then, let's go see if you're right!

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:49.420
Wait!

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.710
Nice work, Yuji.

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.710
You were right! But...

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.460
There's one missing!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:08.500
Must be up above.

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:21.290
Leave 'em to me!

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.080
Wow, he's good.

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.040
Nicely done, Rodis!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.210
Thanks! You saved us there.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.460
We better keep moving.

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.580
I changed my mind about you, Yuji.

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.210
Okay...

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:53.210
We could have taken them down ourselves.

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:56.290
Sure, but sometimes it's good to know
how strong your companions are.

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.790
Yuji, hurry up!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.000
Should've guessed it'd take more than a day.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:09.250
Why did you take us off the path?

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:13.000
Best to set up camp a ways away
when you're in a smaller group.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.000
Never know when bandits might show.

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:16.630
Makes sense.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:24.790
You sure seem to get along.

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:27.500
Yeah. This thing's my trusted partner.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.250
He trusts us!

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.000
We're a team!

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:38.580
How did you get so good at tracking enemies?

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:41.250
Did someone teach you?

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.040
Well actually...

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.750
One day I just realized I could do it.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.710
What? No way!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:54.420
You didn't learn from some master tracker?

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:55.250
Nope...

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.460
Are you hiding something from us?

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.040
Tell us the truth!

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:00.790
How do I explain it?

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.710
All right, it's time we get some rest.

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:11.670
Tina will take first watch.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:12.710
I'll go after that.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:14.580
Then Yuji.

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:16.670
And Lisa can take last, okay?

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.130
Why?

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:23.670
Second and third shift get hit harder
because they split up their sleep schedule.

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:28.170
That's why me and you, the non-fighter, will take the hit.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.380
Rodis is more chivalrous than I expected.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.500
I see no reason to complain.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:37.540
Nighty-night everyone!

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:52.540
Where am I?

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.040
I swear I was just at the office working overtime.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:10:06.580
Yuji

00:09:55.040 --> 00:10:06.580
Class: Tamer

00:09:55.040 --> 00:10:06.580
Skills: Taming

00:09:55.040 --> 00:10:06.580
Type: None

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:59.330
Sheesh, I must have been staring
at that screen for too long.

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:04.000
"Skills, Type, HP...?"

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.040
Are these game stats?

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.580
Tamers can control monsters, right?

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:12.500
Funny, since I'm the one controlled
by my monster of a company.

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:18.080
Monster

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:18.080
Slime

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:18.080
Tamed

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.380
That sure feels strange.

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:17.920
"Slime"?

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:21.290
So this thing is my ally, now?

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.380
Looks like it's trying to lead me somewhere.

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:05.880
Whoever lived here sure loved to read.

00:11:15.290 --> 00:11:16.130
Grimoire of Divine Destruction

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:18.290
"Grimoire of Divine Destruction..."

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:21.830
Grimoire of Divine Destruction

00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:21.500
Whoever wrote this definitely had issues.

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:23.380
Skills

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:23.380
Fire Magic, Water Magic, Earth Magic, Wind Magic

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:23.380
Acquired

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:28.580
Magic? Just from reading this? That's a handy system.

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:31.830
That bumped up my HP and MP, too.

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:44.040
Do you all want to be tamed?

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:46.790
Monster

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:46.790
Slime

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:46.790
Tamed

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:49.330
 Monster

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:49.330
Slime

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:49.330
Tamed

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:49.330
Monster

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:49.330
Slime                                    Monster

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.330
Slime

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.330
Tamed

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.330
Tamed

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:50.580
What the...?

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.330
Skill Acquired

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.330
Skill Acquired

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.330
Skill Acquired

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.330
Skill Acquired

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.330
Skill Acquired

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.330
Skill Acquired

00:12:01.050 --> 00:12:03.330
Skill Acquired

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:06.960
I just learned everything the slimes read.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.830
Yuji

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.830
Class: Tamer

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.830
Skills: Taming, Sense Share, Holy Magic, Dark Magic, Fire Magic, Water Magic,

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.830
Ice Magic, Earth Magic, Lightning Magic, Wind Magic, Support Magic, Buff Magic,

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.830
Spell Transfer, Master-class Combat Skills, Magic Maker

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.830
Type: None

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:11.750
Sage

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:13.130
"Sage"?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.420
Yuji!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:18.250
Yuji! Yuji! Yuji! Yuji!

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.380
You can talk?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:26.080
Yuji! Yuji! Yuji! Yuji!

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:28.420
Yuji.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.040
It's already been a week since then, huh?

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:34.130
Yuji, can you hear me?

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.000
What's the matter?

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:38.830
Rodis took off in the middle of his watch.

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:42.880
He ran away, you mean?

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.710
I don't think it's quite like that.

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:49.130
Something's definitely up.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:50.630
Yuji!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.040
Tina and Lisa are gone, too!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:05.330
A-are we busted?

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:06.750
Hard to say.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:10.290
Isn't that...?

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.040
You were right, Tina.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.420
I had my suspicions when he set the watch schedule.

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:19.670
He's not the sort to worry about others like that.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.790
Maybe we should fall back and ask Yuji for help.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.790
He's not cut out for a fight.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.420
We need to handle this ourselves.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:56.630
There you are!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.290
I thought I was gonna get stabbed!

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:24.040
That was "Monster Stealth."
Looks like it helped you slip away.

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.630
What is this place?

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.750
Rodis. What do you have for me?

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:19.920
Two gals who'll fetch a high price and another fella.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:23.580
I'll just say they ran off during our quest, same as always.

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:28.460
Leave the guy be and he'll probably
die off for us anyway.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:33.580
Well, that explains what happened to all his other parties.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:33.880
Sense Share

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:38.330
My guess is the girls are pulling up on us now, too.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.460
We can nab them as soon as they trip our traps.

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.500
All right, let's make this quick.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.040
The moon grows murky already.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:52.710
"Calamity comes beneath the blue moon."

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:59.830
The Blue Moon of Salvation say
disaster will fall when the moon turns blue.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.330
Hah! What a load of crap.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:05.920
F-forgive me!

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.500
Think we ought to trust that story?

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:14.170
The same folks unleashing monsters
all around are afraid of it.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:17.460
We're better off playing it safe.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.080
What should we do?

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.420
Best not stumble in there unprepared.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.380
Let's head back and come up with a plan.

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.330
There they are.

00:16:31.330 --> 00:16:32.790
In the brush to the west.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.710
No choice left but to fight.

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:46.250
Yeah...

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:55.710
I-is that a monster?!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.750
Did that thing trip the trap?

00:16:58.540 --> 00:16:59.630
It looks huge!

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:00.670
We doing this?

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:06.920
Never seen anything like that
around these parts before. Fall back!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:17.290
Water Magic

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:17.290
Ice Magic

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:16.630
Good. Nice work, Proud Wolf.

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.290
Ranged Frost

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.290
Permafrost Curse

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.290
Freeze Barrier

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:20.580
This sounds pretty strong.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:26.290
Ranged Frost - Medium

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:23.630
I guess a weaker move would be...

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:26.250
"Ranged Frost - Medium."

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:27.830
Guess I'll go with that.

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.960
It's a simple, straight-forward sounding sort of move.

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:32.170
Slimes.

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.420
By your command!

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:34.790
Leave it to us!

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:40.130
Are those...

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:41.580
Yuji's slimes?

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:49.380
Spell Transfer! Ranged Frost - Medium!

00:17:57.630 --> 00:18:00.420
Huh. That was a lot stronger than I thought.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:13.920
D-d-did the slimes do all this?

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:15.750
Uhh, yeah...

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.500
Let's let them believe that.

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:22.960
Isn't that Gelios?!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.080
It is!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.630
Friend of yours?

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:28.210
Course not!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.500
He's an infamous bandit around these parts.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.290
Didn't you see the bounty out for him?

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.500
Now that you mention it...

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.080
You didn't even notice, did you...?

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:46.710
So you can do more than track enemies, huh?

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:51.250
If you could do all this,
we shoulda asked for more help from the get-go!

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:06.420
I'd rather not have people depend on me.

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:10.420
You don't like to share much about yourself, do you?

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.330
Not particularly...

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.540
That's fine, though.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:15.920
To each his own and all that!

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:21.080
Now, what about that request?

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:25.500
Guess we ought to head back to town now
that we lost one of our fighters.

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:31.710
Wait. If we use my slimes
we can avoid most encounters.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.830
You wouldn't mind?

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:35.960
Yeah, it's fine.

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:38.500
These two seem trustworthy.

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:41.920
The journey continues, then.

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:44.170
Let's get some rest, first.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:47.130
We'll have to find a new spot to camp...

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:57.420
Yippeeeeeee!

00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:09.750
I found a good spot!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.960
Down in a hollow and out of sight.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:16.580
Get a fire going.

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.000
Coming up!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.080
Next we need tents.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.210
Got it!

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:25.040
As you wish!

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:29.080
Is three enough?

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:30.750
Spread them out a bit more.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.080
Can do!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.330
Put out our leftover food, too.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.750
Okay!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.500
Proud Wolf, let's take turns on guard.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:39.830
Roger that!

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.540
There. All set.

00:20:46.330 --> 00:20:47.670
Thanks...

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:01.710
"Calamity comes beneath the blue moon."

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:09.420
The Blue Moon of Salvation say
disaster will fall when the moon turns blue.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:15.040
The Blue Moon of Salvation
must have been behind the attack on Phastan.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.920
But what "calamity" was he talking about?

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:42.000
EPISODE 2

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:42.000
TRYING OUT A PARTY

00:21:42.380 --> 00:21:44.710
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:47.750
Tansaku mo choutatsu mo ote no mono
Exploration and procurement are our specialties

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:49.130
"Tomodachi takusan tsukretekita yo!"
"Be sure to bring lots of friends!"

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:53.040
Machi made ato ippo no toko de encount
There's always an encounter one step away from town

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.250
"Haa kufuku de! Chikara ga nee!"
"Agh, I'm starved! My strength is gone!"

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:55.710
"Kibichii mamono ga jiirojiro!"
"Look at all these tough baddies!"

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:57.170
"Maji panee! Maji panee!"
"This is ridic! Seriously ridic!"

00:21:57.170 --> 00:22:02.290
"Yabami yaseimi nirami ga sugomi...!"
"Crazy, wild, and super glaring!"

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.380
"Fumu, koko wa okunote shika nai desuzo...!"
"Well it seems time we use our secret weapon!" 

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:01.000
"Sonnano attakke?"
"Since when do we have one?"

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.290
"Niigerun da yo!"
"I say we ruuun!"

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:06.500
Shikashi mawarikomarete shimatta
But we wound up surrounded

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:11.920
Zenmetsu suru to wa nani goto ka!
We're about to experience annihilation!

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:19.790
Yuushatachi yo tachiagare!
Brave heroes stand and fight!

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:21.210
"Karyoku infure zoukyouyaku"
"Firepower boosting potions"

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:22.380
"Kameba kamu hodo chou kaifuku"
"The more you chew, the more you get super healed"

00:22:22.380 --> 00:22:25.290
Tsuyomi ga tsuyomi ga deruzo
Strength strength coursing through us

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:28.290
Happadayo!
Here's some leaves!

00:22:26.670 --> 00:22:28.290
"Itadaitokimashou!"
"Let's take them!"

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:30.630
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:22:32.130 --> 00:22:37.130
Youyaku aritsuketa gohan ga oishii ne!
This food we finally got our hands on is great, huh?

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:39.880
Doukutsu demo mayoi no mori demo
Whether in caves or in the lost woods,

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:42.880
Aa manpuku manzoku shizen no baikingu
Oh we eat our fill from nature's buffet

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:47.920
Onaka ga suite wa ikusa ga dekinai ne!
Can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:53.080
Ikuzo gattai kougekida! Tobikiri magical tsuyoi yatsu
Let's go, give it a fusion attack! A super strong magical one

00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:56.170
Chi o saki hi wo fuke!
Split the earth and breathe fire!

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:57.580
"Hyakuninriki no kyuukyoku mahou da!"
"Ultimate super-powered magic!"

00:22:57.580 --> 00:22:58.960
"Maryoku to cheat no housekibako da!"
"A jewelry box of magical power and cheats!"

00:22:58.960 --> 00:23:00.380
"Shuuen no gouka de ichimoudajin da!"
"Hellfire of Demise will get them all in one go!"

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:03.170
"Toiu yume o mitan da ne?"
"That was all in your dreams, right?"

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:05.790
CHEST!
A CHEST!

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:08.290
Yuji! Yuji! Saikyou! Kenja! Yuji! Yuji! Uoo tame me!
Yuji! Yuji! The best! The Sage! Yuji! Yuji! Oooh tame me!

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:10.630
Gohan da yo! Da da da dan!
Time to eat! Da da da dan!

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:15.040
Time for an isekai preview from us reincarnated slimes!

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:17.670
We slimes are in charge of the previews!

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:18.830
Yay! This sounds fun!

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:21.790
Next we will find ourselves up against a formidable foe!

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:22.920
What is it? What is it?!

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:25.000
Something too terrible to speak of.

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:26.290
Why won't you tell us?

00:23:26.290 --> 00:23:31.630
Because... we slimes harbor truly incredible powers!

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:32.630
What's that supposed to mean?

00:23:32.630 --> 00:23:34.330
Oh, I know! It means this!

00:23:34.540 --> 00:23:36.710
"I meant TOO strong!"

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:42.000
I MEANT TOO STRONG

00:23:36.960 --> 00:23:38.080
Yeah right!

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:39.130
Just kidding.
